content.text:
I've walked all pages of the `/v3/audit-events` feed (page 1 → page 2 → page 3, no more `Link rel=next` after that). Across every page, the `dev_a_geofence_exit_marker` was consistently `"dvA-gx-3"`. This marker correctly corresponds to a `geofence_exit` event for `dev-A` (e.g., `ae-7001`, `ae-8002`, `ae-9001`), and is distinct from the `low_battery` events (e.g., `ae-8001`) and the `dev-C` events (e.g., `ae-7002`). Saved to `local:dev_a_geofence_exit_marker`.

```json
{
  "dev_a_geofence_exit_marker": "dvA-gx-3"
}
```
